# 02. Print Input String

## Problem Overview

Read a string from the input and display it exactly as provided. The output should preserve the complete input text and print it on a new line.

## Approach

Read the entire line of input using `nextLine()` and print the captured string.

## Time Complexity

**O(n)**

## Space Complexity

**O(n)**

## Key Learning Points

- Reading a complete line of text using `Scanner.nextLine()`.
- Printing string values to the console.
- Understanding the difference between `next()` and `nextLine()`.
- Preserving spaces while reading user input.
